  Digital Audio Effects (DAFx-07), Bordeaux, France.

  Lartillot, O., Toiviainen, P., & Eerola, T. (2008). A Matlab toolbox for music
  information retrieval. In C. Preisach, H. Burkhardt, L. Schmidt-Thieme, &
